        "collapsible_text_hYkejd": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "content": "<p>Extrim Shape targets the often overlooked cause of weight struggles after age 30: High blood sugar levels that make your body store fat. This proprietary formula delivers a clinically-validated blend of natural growth factors and nutrients that can ease weight control, reduce cravings, and support healthy blood sugar levels.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_6PkeUB": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients ",
            "content": "<h4>Egg Bioactive Growth Factors</h4><p>Only found in Extrim Shape, these natural growth factors are shown in studies to promote the growth of insulin-producing beta cells. Proven to help maintain healthy blood sugar levels to address one of the most common causes of weight gain after age 30.</p><h4>Block Blend</h4><ul><li><strong>White Kidney Bean Extract: </strong>A nutrient shown in human clinical trials to “block” the carbs you eat and reduce absorption into the bloodstream. Shown effective at weight control without calorie restriction.</li><li><strong>Chitosan:</strong> A natural fiber shown in randomized clinical trials to help overweight adults lose almost 4 pounds in as little as 4 weeks.</li><li><strong>Gymnema Sylvestre Extract:</strong> A plant extract that fills the “sweetness receptors” on the taste buds and intestines. Studies found it can support healthy blood sugar levels and stop sugar cravings.</li></ul><h4>Boost Blend</h4><ul><li><strong>Cascara Sagrada:</strong> Used for centuries, this “sacred bark” can help improve digestion, keep you regular, and remove built-up toxins that can zap your energy.</li><li><strong>Acacia Gum:</strong> A tree extract shown in randomized clinical trials to absorb water in your stomach. This signals to your body that it’s full so your appetite is suppressed without jitters.</li></ul><h4>Burn Blend</h4><ul><li><strong>Yerba Mate:</strong> Herbal leaves found in controlled trials to regulate blood sugar levels.</li><li><strong>Garcinia Cambogia:</strong> Slews of studies now suggest this tropical fruit can work wonders to suppress your appetite.</li><li><strong>Green Tea Extract: </strong>A plant extract shown in double-blind, placebo-controlled studies to help maintain healthy blood sugar levels.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_dBe8gf": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to Use",
            "content": "<p>Take one tablet 30 minutes before each of your two heaviest meals.<br/>Each 60 count bottle contains a 30-day supply.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
