    "faq_CRPmGh": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_GRFrEe": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does Extrim Shape work? ",
            "content": "<p>It combines the most cutting-edge, science-backed nutrients that function in 9 ways to help control blood sugar levels. And simplify weight management.<br/><br/>First, the proprietary egg bioactive growth factors help replenish your body’s insulin-producing beta cells, which diminish with age.<br/><br/>Then the other 8 nutrients complement these growth factors. In the “Ingredients” section above, you’ll discover how each of the nutrients in the formula works together to ease struggles with weight control.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_mTqekd": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Extrim Shape vegan, dairy-free, and gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, it’s made from natural ingredients that are safe, free of side effects, and well-tolerated by even the most sensitive stomachs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_DgicBM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I take Extrim Shape?",
